        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present this magnificent two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the Dublin 8 property market. Ideally located in the secure and highly regarded Cameron Court development on Cork Street\n\nThe location of Cameron Court is truly second to none, offering a perfect blend of city-centre energy and local community charm. You are situated within a 15-minute walk of St. Stephen's Green and the heart of the city, with the Coombe Maternity Hospital and the Digital Hub just moments away. For the commuter, several major bus routes pass right by your front door, and the Red Luas line is reachable within a short stroll. With a wealth of trendy cafes, traditional pubs, and modern supermarkets all on your doorstep, this is urban living at its absolute finest.\n\nInternal living accommodation of c 71 sq m is bright, airy, and exceptionally well-proportioned. Upon entering, you are greeted by a welcoming hallway that leads into a spacious, open-plan living and dining area.. The contemporary kitchen opens directly into the main living space, cleverly partitioned by a stylish breakfast bar this extended countertop acts as a built-in dining space making it perfect for modern city living and absolutely ideal for hosting and socialising. \n\nThe apartment features two generous double bedrooms, both featuring quality flooring and ample built-in wardrobe space. The master suite is a true highlight, benefiting from its own private ensuite bathroom, while a modern family bathroom serves the rest of the apartment. Set within a well-maintained and secure complex with lift access, this property also has the added benefit of a designated underground car space. No. 7 Cameron Court is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a high-spec asset in one of Dublin's most rapidly improving districts.\n\nEarly viewing is highly advised. Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today!\n\nFeatures:\nBER C\nC. 71 sq m \n2 Bed 2 Bath\nManagement fee c 1,950\n North facing balcony\nStunning condition throughout\nSecure gated development\nExpansive open-plan living space\nSecure underground designated car space\nFreshly painted\nMaster ensuite bathroom\nLift access\nPrime Dublin 8 location\nPerfect for first time buyers and investors alike\nViewing highly advised!\n\nDirections :\nExiting the M50 at Junction 9 (Red Cow), merge onto the R110/Naas Road heading citybound. Continue straight for approximately 6km, passing through Inchicore and onto Longmile Road/Dolphin's Barn. As you reach the major junction at Dolphin's Barn, continue straight onto Cork Street. Proceed for another 500 meters, and you will find Cameron Court conveniently located on your left-hand side, just before the junction with Marrowbone Lane."
      },
